# Benchmark output — do NOT track run artifacts in git.
# Sync via rclone to Google Drive instead (scripts/sync_results_drive.sh /
# scripts/sync_results_local.sh). Only the results_layout *module*
# (experiment/results_layout.py) is tracked; the output trees below are not.
# Anchored directory patterns (trailing slash = dirs only, leading slash =
# anchored here) so they never match experiment/results_layout.py.
/results/
/results_bak/
/results_old/
# Zip artifacts from the sync scripts (in case they're left in the repo root).
/*.zip
/tmp/